1246
01:07:59.396 --> 01:08:03.230
separado

1247
01:08:05.402 --> 01:08:09.896
Y esa risa

1248
01:08:09.940 --> 01:08:13.432
que te rellenan el nariz

1249
01:08:15.512 --> 01:08:18.675
